{
  "title": { "zh": "让读数有邻居", "en": "Give readings a neighbourhood" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "质检台只能逐位置比较，无法利用周围读数区分细碎干扰和较大结构。这章要造邻域处理器，再把它装成扫描器。先从三个位置开始：取样位置与贡献权重分开，所有数值由电路计算。 <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "The station compares individual locations but cannot use surrounding readings to separate fine nuisance from broader structure. Build a neighbourhood processor and then a scanner. Start with three positions: sample locations and contributions are separate; the circuit does the arithmetic. <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "fig": "weighted-line"
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "同一套位置权重可以沿行或列使用；读取方向决定哪些邻居参与，权重的位置与符号决定各自的贡献。每次处理仍然只覆盖一条线。 <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "One positional weighting rule can act along rows or columns. Direction selects the neighbours; weight position and sign determine their contributions. Each pass still covers one line. <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v1_line",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "三路贡献",
        "en": "Three contributions"
      },
      "configurations": { "arithmetic.op": ["add", "mul"] },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "用给定的位置权重组合左、中、右三个读数。取样方向 d=(1,0)，前侧读 -d，后侧读 d。输出与输入同尺寸，图外取 0；权重不必总为正，也不自动归一化。",
        "en": "Combine left, centre and right readings with the supplied positional weights. The direction is d=(1,0): read the first at -d and the last at d. Preserve image size, read zero outside, and do not automatically normalise or discard negative weights."
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "权重的位置、符号与总和分别影响方向、响应与增益。负权重和非单位增益也有用途。 <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "Weight positions, signs and sum affect direction, response and gain. Negative weights and non-unit gain can be useful. <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "读数图", "en": "Readings" } },
        { "name": "left", "label": { "zh": "前侧", "en": "First" } },
        { "name": "centre", "label": { "zh": "中心", "en": "Centre" } },
        { "name": "right", "label": { "zh": "后侧", "en": "Last" } },
        { "name": "d", "type": "vector", "label": { "zh": "取样方向 d", "en": "Sampling direction d" } }
      ],
      "inputGroups": [
        {
          "name": "weights",
          "label": { "zh": "邻域权重", "en": "Neighbourhood weights" },
          "inputs": ["left", "centre", "right"]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "加权结果", "en": "Weighted result" } }],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0, 0, 1, 0, 0]],
            "left": 0.25,
            "centre": 0.5,
            "right": 0.25,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.25, 0]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6]],
            "left": 0.3333333333333333,
            "centre": 0.3333333333333333,
            "right": 0.3333333333333333,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.39999999999999997, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.39999999999999997]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.4], [0.7, 0.1, 0.5]],
            "left": -1,
            "centre": 0,
            "right": 1,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.8, 0.2, -0.8], [0.1, -0.19999999999999996, -0.1]] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.7], [0.2]],
            "left": 0.2,
            "centre": 0.6,
            "right": 0.2,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.42], [0.12]] }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "minus = const[value=-1]()",
        "negative = arithmetic[op=mul](d,minus)",
        "l = shift(image,negative)",
        "r = shift(image,d)",
        "a = arithmetic[op=mul](l,left)",
        "b = arithmetic[op=mul](image,centre)",
        "c = arithmetic[op=mul](r,right)",
        "ab = arithmetic[op=add](a,b)",
        "total = arithmetic[op=add](ab,c)",
        "out <- total"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "minus = const[value=-1]()",
        "negative = arithmetic[op=mul](d,minus)",
        "l = shift(image,negative)",
        "r = shift(image,d)",
        "a = arithmetic[op=mul](l,right)",
        "b = arithmetic[op=mul](image,centre)",
        "c = arithmetic[op=mul](r,left)",
        "ab = arithmetic[op=add](a,b)",
        "s = arithmetic[op=add](ab,c)",
        "out <- s"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "位置权重跟随读取的位置；交换两侧会反转非对称规则。恒定图还会显示权重和造成的增益。",
        "en": "Weights belong to positions. Swapping sides reverses an asymmetric rule; constants also expose the gain from the weight sum."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "亮点能显示谁贡献到哪个位置；先把三路分别接到输出观察，再组合。",
          "en": "An impulse reveals which sample contributes where. Inspect the branches before combining them."
        },
        {
          "zh": "常量图检验总增益，非对称权重检验方向；系统计算所有乘积与和。",
          "en": "Constants test gain and asymmetric weights test direction; products and sums are automatic."
        }
      ],
      "starter": [
        "minus = const[value=-1]()",
        "negative = arithmetic[op=mul](d,minus)",
        "l = shift(image,negative)",
        "r = shift(image,d)"
      ],
      "adds": ["const"]
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_vertical",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": { "zh": "把邻居换到上下", "en": "Move the neighbourhood to columns" },
      "configurations": {},
      "brief": {
        "zh": "按给定方向 d 组合前侧、当前、后侧的读数，分别使用三项权重。d=(0,1) 时读取上、中、下；(1,0) 时读取左、中、右。前侧使用 -d，后侧使用 d，图外取 0，保持原图尺寸。",
        "en": "Combine first, current and last readings along the supplied direction d using the three weights. d=(0,1) reads above/centre/below; (1,0) reads left/centre/right. Read the first at -d and the last at d, using zero outside and preserving image size."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "读数图", "en": "Readings" } },
        { "name": "left", "label": { "zh": "前侧", "en": "First" } },
        { "name": "centre", "label": { "zh": "中心", "en": "Centre" } },
        { "name": "right", "label": { "zh": "后侧", "en": "Last" } },
        { "name": "d", "type": "vector", "label": { "zh": "取样方向 d", "en": "Sampling direction d" } }
      ],
      "inputGroups": [
        {
          "name": "weights",
          "label": { "zh": "邻域权重", "en": "Neighbourhood weights" },
          "inputs": ["left", "centre", "right"]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "方向加权结果", "en": "Directional weighted result" } }],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0, 0, 0], [0, 1, 0], [0, 0, 0]],
            "left": 0.25,
            "centre": 0.5,
            "right": 0.25,
            "d": { "x": 0, "y": 1 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0, 0.25, 0], [0, 0.5, 0], [0, 0.25, 0]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.4], [0.7, 0.1, 0.5]],
            "left": -1,
            "centre": 0,
            "right": 1,
            "d": { "x": 0, "y": 1 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.7, 0.1, 0.5], [-0.2, -0.8, -0.4]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.6, 0.6], [0.6, 0.6], [0.6, 0.6], [0.6, 0.6]],
            "left": 0.25,
            "centre": 0.5,
            "right": 0.25,
            "d": { "x": 0, "y": 1 }
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [0.44999999999999996, 0.44999999999999996],
              [0.6, 0.6],
              [0.6, 0.6],
              [0.44999999999999996, 0.44999999999999996]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.4]],
            "left": 0.2,
            "centre": 0.6,
            "right": 0.2,
            "d": { "x": 0, "y": 1 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.12, 0.48, 0.24]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0, 0, 1, 0, 0]],
            "left": 0.25,
            "centre": 0.5,
            "right": 0.25,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.25, 0]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6]],
            "left": 0.3333333333333333,
            "centre": 0.3333333333333333,
            "right": 0.3333333333333333,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.39999999999999997, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.39999999999999997]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.4], [0.7, 0.1, 0.5]],
            "left": -1,
            "centre": 0,
            "right": 1,
            "d": { "x": 1, "y": 0 }
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.8, 0.2, -0.8], [0.1, -0.19999999999999996, -0.1]] }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "minus = const[value=-1]()",
        "negative = arithmetic[op=mul](d,minus)",
        "l = shift(image,negative)",
        "r = shift(image,d)",
        "a = arithmetic[op=mul](l,left)",
        "b = arithmetic[op=mul](image,centre)",
        "c = arithmetic[op=mul](r,right)",
        "ab = arithmetic[op=add](a,b)",
        "total = arithmetic[op=add](ab,c)",
        "out <- total"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "minus = const[value=-1]()",
        "negative = arithmetic[op=mul](d,minus)",
        "l = shift(image,d)",
        "r = shift(image,negative)",
        "a = arithmetic[op=mul](l,left)",
        "b = arithmetic[op=mul](image,centre)",
        "c = arithmetic[op=mul](r,right)",
        "ab = arithmetic[op=add](a,b)",
        "total = arithmetic[op=add](ab,c)",
        "out <- total"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "交换前后读取方向会反转非对称权重的响应。用不对称权重检查上、下是否交换。",
        "en": "Reversing the read direction reverses the response of asymmetric weights. Use unequal side weights to distinguish above and below."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先用单个亮点观察响应是在同一行还是同一列展开；再用不对称权重检查上、下是否交换。无需手算数值。",
          "en": "Use one impulse to see whether support spreads along its row or column, then asymmetric weights to check above/below order. Numerical calculation is automatic."
        }
      ],
      "starter": [
        "minus = const[value=-1]()",
        "negative = arithmetic[op=mul](d,minus)",
        "b = arithmetic[op=mul](image,centre)"
      ],
      "adds": [],
      "carries": true,
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "同一列的上、下读数也会影响中心。继续使用偏移取样，把方向改为 d=(0,1)。封装时将方向向量 d 留作输入，让后续电路选择横向或纵向。先观察一列的响应，再处理整张图。 <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>",
            "en": "Readings above and below also contribute to a centre. Reuse offset read with direction d=(0,1). Expose the direction vector d as an input so later circuits can select rows or columns. Inspect a column before processing the full image. <wiki-ref to=\"weighted-neighbourhood\"></wiki-ref>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "builds": {
    "type": "weightedLine",
    "name": { "zh": "三点加权器", "en": "Weighted line" },
    "desc": {
      "zh": "沿给定方向向量 d，按前侧、中心、后侧权重汇合三格读数。d=(1,0) 横向，(0,1) 纵向；图外规则可设置。",
      "en": "Combine first/centre/last readings along direction vector d: (1,0) horizontally or (0,1) vertically, with explicit borders."
    },
    "settings": ["outside"],
    "defaults": { "outside": "zero" }
  }
}
